@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz/liveness

### 2. [AUTH] Vecino al día (B14) inicia sesión -> Token válido por 30 días
# @name loginResidentB14
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 190.236.10.14

{
  "username": "B14",
  "password": "VC3-B14"
}

### 3. [AUTH] Vigilante de Garita inicia sesión (No tiene lote asignado)
# @name loginGuard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.10

{
  "username": "guardia1",
  "password": "guardia123"
}

### 4. [AUTH] Administrador inicia sesión
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.99

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 5. [VECINO B14] Crea un pase con 1 toque (No necesita mandar lot_id, sale de su JWT)
# @name createPass
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginResidentB14.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 190.236.10.14

{
  "pass_type": "TAXI",
  "visitor_info": "Uber Gris"
}

### 6. [GARITA] Vigilante verifica el QR/Código de 6 dígitos y registra DNI + Placa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGuard.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.10

{
  "code": "{{createPass.response.body.code}}",
  "visitor_dni": "45891230",
  "vehicle_plate": "B7J-412"
}

### 7. [ADMIN] Carga Masiva de Lotes (Upsert + Autogeneración de claves WhatsApp)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lots": [
    {
      "lot_id": "B14",
      "owner_name": "Jesus Plasencia",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "U28",
      "owner_name": "Familia Salgado",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "P20",
      "owner_name": "Familia Torres",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    }
  ]
}

### 8. [ADMIN] Consultar IPs bloqueadas por Fuerza Bruta / Password Spraying y vecino sospechoso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/security/blocked-ips
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
